sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sender as Sender Mobile App
    participant S3 as S3 Encrypted Bucket
    participant Realtime as Realtime Gateway
    participant Recipient as Recipient Mobile App

    Sender->>Sender: Generate Random AES-256 Media Key (K_media) + IV
    Sender->>Sender: Encrypt Media File with K_media (AES-256-GCM)
    Sender->>S3: Upload Encrypted Media Ciphertext via Presigned URL
    Sender->>Sender: Encrypt K_media inside E2EE Message Envelope
    Sender->>Realtime: Send E2EE Message Envelope (Contains S3 ObjectKey + Encrypted K_media)
    Realtime->>Recipient: Relay Encrypted Envelope
    Recipient->>Recipient: Decrypt E2EE Envelope to extract K_media & ObjectKey
    Recipient->>S3: Download Ciphertext Blob from S3
    Recipient->>Recipient: Decrypt Media File using K_media
